# Theme 12 — opt-in pre-push gate. Symlink this file to `pre-push`
# when you want the full `pnpm -w run gate` chain (typecheck + knip
# + per-package coverage + build) to fire before every push.
#
# On Windows / POSIX:
#   cd .husky && cp pre-push.optional pre-push   # or symlink
#
# This is INTENTIONALLY not the default — the gate takes ~5-10
# minutes wall-clock (full coverage run), which is heavier than the
# typical Atlas single-owner direct-to-main commit cadence wants.
# The secretlint pre-commit hook stays mandatory regardless (it
# blocks credentials reaching history, which is non-negotiable).

pnpm -w run gate
